<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Guide Complet : S'installer au Mexique - ZineInsight</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Guide complet pour réussir votre installation au Mexique : logement, emploi, visa, culture, coût de la vie et conseils pratiques.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Mexique, expatriation, installation, guide, logement, emploi, visa, Mexico, Guadalajara, Monterrey, Cancún">

    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="Guide Complet : S'installer au Mexique">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Guide d'expertise pour réussir votre expatriation au Mexique">
    <meta property="og:image"
        content="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518105779142-d975f22f1b0a?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2070&q=80">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --mexico-green: #006847;
            --mexico-white: #FFFFFF;
            --mexico-red: #CE1126;
            --mexico-dark-green: #004B35;
            --mexico-light-red: #E85D75;
            --warm-beige: #FFF9F0;
            --aztec-gold: #DAA520;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--warm-beige) 0%, #ffffff 100%);
        }

        .hero-section {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.7), rgba(206, 17, 38, 0.7)),
                url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518105779142-d975f22f1b0a?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2070&q=80') center/cover;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-bar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .section-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mexico-green), var(--mexico-red));
            color: white;
            padding: 3rem 0;
            margin: 4rem 0 2rem 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -2px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--mexico-green);
        }

        .content-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin: 2rem 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .content-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .premium-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--mexico-green), var(--mexico-dark-green));
            color: white;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.3);
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fff4, #e6ffed);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--mexico-green);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
        }

        .city-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .city-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .city-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .info-tag {
            background: var(--aztec-gold);
            color: var(--mexico-dark-green);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .discover-button {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mexico-green), var(--mexico-red));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.3);
        }

        .discover-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.4);
            color: white;
        }

        .flag-emoji {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-right: 1rem;
        }

        .icon-mexico {
            color: var(--mexico-green);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .testimonial-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.05), rgba(206, 17, 38, 0.05));
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--mexico-green);
        }

        .benefit-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-top: 3px solid var(--aztec-gold);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .benefit-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .stats-container {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mexico-dark-green), var(--mexico-green));
            color: white;
            padding: 3rem 0;
            margin: 3rem 0;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--aztec-gold);
        }

        .budget-bar {
            height: 8px;
            background: #e9ecef;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .budget-fill {
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .budget-item {
            padding: 1rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }

        .budget-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .navigation-dots {
            position: fixed;
            right: 30px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.3);
            margin: 10px 0;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .dot.active {
            background: var(--mexico-green);
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        .floating-action {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mexico-green), var(--mexico-red));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 998;
        }

        .floating-action:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(0, 104, 71, 0.6);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-section {
                height: 80vh;
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            .navigation-dots {
                display: none;
            }
            .city-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg nav-bar">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold" href="../index.html">
                <span class="flag-emoji">🇲🇽</span> ZineInsight Mexique
            </a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#overview">Vue d'ensemble</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#cities">Villes</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#cost-living">Coût de la vie</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#employment">Emploi</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#visa">Visa</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#lifestyle">Mode de vie</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#education">Éducation</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#healthcare">Santé</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Navigation Dots -->
    <div class="navigation-dots">
        <div class="dot active" data-section="hero"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="overview"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="cities"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="cost-living"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="employment"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="visa"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="lifestyle"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="education"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="healthcare"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Floating Action Button -->
    <button class="floating-action" onclick="scrollToTop()">
        <i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i>
    </button>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section" id="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
                    <div class="flag-emoji mb-4">🇲🇽</div>
                    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4">Votre Nouvelle Vie au Mexique</h1>
                    <p class="lead mb-5">Découvrez le guide complet pour réussir votre installation au Mexique. 
                    De Mexico à Guadalajara, vivez l'authenticité mexicaine dans un pays aux traditions millénaires et à l'économie dynamique.</p>
                    <div class="premium-badge mb-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-star me-2"></i>Guide Premium Complet
                    </div>
                    <br>
                    <button class="discover-button btn-lg" onclick="document.getElementById('overview').scrollIntoView()">
                        <i class="fas fa-compass me-2"></i>Découvrir le Mexique
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Overview Section -->
    <section id="overview" class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt me-3"></i>Pourquoi le Mexique ?
                </h2>
                <p class="lead">Une destination d'expatriation authentique et dynamique</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="icon-mexico mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-history fa-2x"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Héritage Millénaire</h4>
                        <p>Berceau des civilisations aztèque et maya, patrimoine UNESCO exceptionnel. Une richesse culturelle unique au monde.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="icon-mexico mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-handshake fa-2x"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Proximité USA/Canada</h4>
                        <p>AEUMC/USMCA offre des opportunités commerciales uniques. Hub manufacturier vers l'Amérique du Nord.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="icon-mexico mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-dollar-sign fa-2x"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Coût de Vie Attractif</h4>
                        <p>Qualité de vie élevée à prix abordable. Un peso fort qui permet un excellent pouvoir d'achat pour les expatriés.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stats-container">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">130M+</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Population</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">15ème</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">PIB Mondial</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">35</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Sites UNESCO</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">32</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">États Fédéraux</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cities Section -->
    <section id="cities" class="py-5 bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">
                    <i class="fas fa-city me-3"></i>Principales Villes du Mexique
                </h2>
                <p class="lead">Découvrez les métropoles mexicaines</p>
            </div>

            <div class="city-grid">
                <!-- Mexico City -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585464231875-d9ef1f5ad396?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Mexico City" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-building me-2 icon-mexico"></i>Mexico (CDMX)
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Capitale dynamique, centre politique et culturel. Plus grande métropole d'Amérique du Nord avec une économie diversifiée.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">22M habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Centre économique</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Plus grand marché du travail</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Hub financier Latam</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Scène culturelle exceptionnelle</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Guadalajara -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512813195386-6cf811ad3542?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Guadalajara" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-microchip me-2 icon-mexico"></i>Guadalajara
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Silicon Valley mexicaine, berceau de la tequila et des mariachis. Ville technologique avec authenticité culturelle.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">5.2M habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Tech Hub</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Centre technologique national</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Culture traditionnelle préservée</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Coût de la vie abordable</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Monterrey -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590523741831-ab7e8b8f9c7f?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Monterrey" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-industry me-2 icon-mexico"></i>Monterrey
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Capitale industrielle du Mexique, surnommée la "Sultan du Nord". Centre manufacturier et business proche des USA.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">5.3M habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Hub industriel</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>PIB per capita le plus élevé</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Proximité États-Unis</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Secteur automobile développé</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Cancún -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Cancún" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-umbrella-beach me-2 icon-mexico"></i>Cancún
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Paradis tropical des Caraïbes mexicaines, capitale mondiale du tourisme. Lifestyle balnéaire et économie touristique.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">900K habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Tourisme international</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Riviera Maya exceptionnelle</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Économie touristique forte</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Communauté expat importante</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cost of Living Section -->
    <section id="cost-living" class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">
                    <i class="fas fa-dollar-sign me-3"></i>Coût de la Vie au Mexique
                </h2>
                <p class="lead">Budget réaliste pour vivre confortablement</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="content-card">
                        <div class="card-body p-4">
                            <h4><i class="fas fa-home icon-mexico me-2"></i>Logement</h4>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Mexico City (CDMX)</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Studio centre : $8,000-15,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 1BR zones prisées : $12,000-25,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 2BR banlieue : $10,000-18,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                        <li>• Colocation : $4,000-8,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Guadalajara</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Studio centre : $6,000-12,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 1BR zones résidentielles : $8,000-16,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 2BR banlieue : $7,000-14,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                        <li>• Colocation : $3,000-6,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <h4 class="mt-4"><i class="fas fa-shopping-cart icon-mexico me-2"></i>Alimentation & Courses</h4>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Supermarché (par semaine)</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Couple : $1,200-2,000 MXN</li>
                                        <li>• Famille de 4 : $2,200-3,500 MXN</li>
                                        <li>• Célibataire : $800-1,400 MXN</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Restaurants</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Comida corrida : $80-150 MXN</li>
                                        <li>• Restaurant milieu de gamme : $300-600 MXN</li>
                                        <li>• Café : $30-60 MXN</li>
                                        <li>• Margarita : $80-180 MXN</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <h4 class="mt-4"><i class="fas fa-bus icon-mexico me-2"></i>Transport</h4>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Transport Public</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Métro Mexico : $5 MXN/trajet</li>
                                        <li>• Bus urbain : $8-12 MXN</li>
                                        <li>• Uber (course moyenne) : $60-120 MXN</li>
                                        <li>• Taxi : $80-150 MXN/course</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Voiture</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Essence : $22-24 MXN/L</li>
                                        <li>• Assurance : $2,000-5,000 MXN/an</li>
                                        <li>• Parking centre : $20-50 MXN/heure</li>
                                        <li>• Entretien : $1,500-3,000 MXN/mois</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="content-card">
                        <div class="card-body p-4">
                            <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">Budget Mensuel Moyen</h5>
                            
                            <div class="budget-item mb-3">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span><strong>Couple Mexico City</strong></span>
                                </div>
